---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PolicyPage title="Refunds & Returns" description="Returns, replacements, cancellations and refunds for handmade and customised candles from Melt & Box Co." updated="13 October 2026">
  <p>Every candle is handmade and many are customised just for you, so we keep our policy simple and fair.</p>

  <h2>Non-returnable items</h2>
  <p>Handmade and customised items can't be returned or exchanged for a change of mind.</p>

  <h2>Damaged or wrong items</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If your order arrives damaged or you receive the wrong item, message us as soon as possible after delivery.</li>
    <li>Please share a clear <b>unboxing photo or video</b> on WhatsApp ({SITE.phone}).</li>
    <li>Once we've checked it, we'll send a replacement or refund you.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Natural variations</h2>
  <p>Because our candles are handmade, slight differences in shade, shape, glitter or finish are normal and aren't defects.</p>

  <h2>Cancellations</h2>
  <p>To cancel, contact us directly on WhatsApp or by phone ({SITE.phone}). Your order is cancelled only once we've talked with you and confirmed the cancellation. Custom orders can't be cancelled once we've started making them.</p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>We don't take payment on the website; you pay us only after we contact you and confirm your order. If a refund is due, we agree it with you directly and send it by UPI or bank transfer.</p>
</PolicyPage>
